		"description": "<p>This massive shield functions as a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-adventuring-gear.Item.udvqt7222qrr3ibu]{Tower Shield}, but can be used to bash if you have a weapon with the defensive (medium) or defensive (heavy) property. When you finish a long or short rest, you can spend 5 points from your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.my42mip0qc35rcp2]{Lay on Hands} pool or a 1st-level spell slot to imbue it with sacred energy. If you do, its base AC rises to 3 and it deals 1d8 points of bludgeoning damage when used to bash. Both effects last until you begin a rest.</p>",
